{
  "about": "Insight gold questions for Plant 7 (#203). Each call is insights.insights or insights.shift_report; expect lists items the answers must contain. A finding is matched by its rule (the text it opens with) and the entity refs it names, never by its wording; cites lists the corpus files the answers must cite.",
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "I1",
      "question": "What did the CV-2 jam hold up, at 10:10 on 2026-10-20?",
